# Blocked scopes. One entry per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
#   area:<name or id>      every project and to-do in that area
#   project:<name or id>   the project and every to-do in it
#   tag:<name or id>       items with that tag or any of its child tags,
#                          including tags inherited from a project or area
#   unfiled                to-dos that belong to no project and no area
#
# Names match case-insensitively and exactly (not as substrings). Blocked
# items are dropped BEFORE the response JSON is written, so their titles and
# notes never reach the assistant, and changes to them are refused.
# The blocklist always takes precedence over the allowlist.
#
# Examples (remove the # to activate):
# area:Health
# project:Taxes 2026
# tag:Private
